    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paradise: Musubi</strong>  the sequel to the popular Japanese BL suspense visual novel <strong>Paradise</strong>, is developed by PIL/SLASH, published by JAST, and, like the main game, features original artwork by Kotomi Youji and is written by  LOVE&amp;DESTROY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paradise: Musubi</strong>  offering the continuation of each of the good ends from the original game with new scenes, beautiful new CGs, and the excellent cast of voice actors from the original.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After living with Mitsugi, unravel Mitsugi's mysterious past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After living with Matsuda, face the shadows of the island together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After escaping overseas with Takara, return to Japan and challenge the authority of the family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beloved supporting characters Shimada and Hongou will also have side stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Happy-End Afterstories:</strong> Unlock new story arcs for the three main male characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Characters:</strong> Each story arc will unlock friends, colleagues, and relatives who did not appear in the main game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revisit key moments:</strong> once you've cleared each character's main good end storyline, you have the opportunity to revisit key moments from the first game's plot, now with new perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576360/extras/91987307b608c767955129ea60ea2c93.avif?t=1755066824\" width=620 height=420 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576360/extras/6d800fca8c9687e25f5e9cd9f5fa09b8.avif?t=1755066824\" width=620 height=420 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576360/extras/9a0821fea635b4c75e6bf63449e19051.avif?t=1755066824\" width=620 height=420 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576360/extras/ab5b0344b98dfbbb3adf1a70eeac00dc.avif?t=1755066824\" width=620 height=420 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576360/extras/c7071bcd99471504ebb0ed5841a64792.avif?t=1755066824\" width=620 height=420 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576360/extras/74587773bf5d1e3724ac96e17251b294.avif?t=1755066824\" width=620 height=420 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576360/extras/909dfd79863fbd64ee5ed894b49a00d9.avif?t=1755066824\" width=620 height=420 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576360/extras/c96d02982bc830e5bd724836e143e5c4.avif?t=1755066824\" width=620 height=420 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576360/extras/d6ad82792e8d624a4f47f0d2e76b36bf.avif?t=1755066824\" width=620 height=420 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st